          "text": "Na ĩndĩ kwa ũla ũtonya kũmũsũvĩa mũikalulutĩke, na kũmwia mbee wa ũtheu wake mũtisu mũte na ũndũ ũtaĩle na mwĩ na ũtanu mũthonoku, ",
